Add OpenHarmony (OHOS) platform support to config.guess and config.sub

This patch adds recognition for the OpenHarmony (ohos) platform to
GNU config's config.guess and config.sub scripts, enabling the
autotools build system to correctly identify the platform as
aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos.

Modified files:
- build-aux/config.guess: Added ohos LIBC detection and output format
- build-aux/config.sub: Added ohos-linux and linux-ohos OS aliases

These modifications are based on standard GNU config OpenHarmony patches.
